<title>SPAIN: Endesa changes div payment date to July 7.</title>
<headline>Endesa changes div payment date to July 7.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Empresa Nacional de Electricidad (Endesa) said on Wednesday it will pay a final dividend of 180 pesetas gross on July 7 instead of on June 17 as previously said.</p>
<p>No-one at Endesa was available to comment on the reason for the change.</p>
<p>The dividend is subject to approval by the shareholders' meeting.</p>
<p>The total dividend this year will be 280 pesetas, up 50.5 percent from previous year's dividend of 186 pesetas.</p>
<p>An interim dividend of 100 pesetas was paid in January.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
